@startuml
' Figure 28.4  Persisted state across runs (state diagram)
' Reading order: top to bottom from Active. Each state is a row in
' the run store under watch:<id>, saved after every step, so the next
' run starts where the last one stopped. From loops.state and
' loops.fare_watch.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
state "Handed off" as HandedOff
[*] --> Active
Active --> Judged : Below floor
Judged --> Active : Saved
Judged --> Vouchered : Comparable
Vouchered --> Active : Lowered
Judged --> HandedOff : Over cap
Active --> Paused : Stall
Paused --> Active : Resume
@enduml
